WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.689 --> 00:00:17.175
For months the Hwalbindang punished greedy officials.

2
00:00:19.276 --> 00:00:20.997
They gave grain to the people.

3
00:00:24.579 --> 00:00:27.040
News of the bandits spread far and wide.

4
00:00:29.356 --> 00:00:32.597
Soldiers were searching all over for the Hwalbindang.

5
00:00:40.619 --> 00:00:43.080
One day Gildong returned to the hideout.

6
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.301
When he arrived, Mok was waiting.

7
00:00:46.321 --> 00:00:49.962
"We have a problem, boss," Mok said.

8
00:00:54.203 --> 00:00:58.100
He took Gildong to see Chibong.

9
00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.741
Chibong's face had bruises.

10
00:01:00.941 --> 00:01:03.202
Nabi was wrapping his arm with a bandage.

11
00:01:03.222 --> 00:01:05.403
"What happened?"

12
00:01:05.723 --> 00:01:06.664
Gildong asked.

13
00:01:08.244 --> 00:01:11.786
"My team got captured in Mungyeong," Chibong said.

14
00:01:11.806 --> 00:01:14.427
"I barely managed to escape.

15
00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:17.648
The rest of them are still there in jail."

16
00:01:17.668 --> 00:01:21.490
"We need to rescue our friends!"

17
00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:22.690
Nabi said.

18
00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:26.612
"The jail is heavily guarded," Chibong said.

19
00:01:27.296 --> 00:01:28.737
"We'll need a good plan."

20
00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:31.720
Mok looked at Gildong.

21
00:01:32.921 --> 00:01:34.162
"What are we going to do?"

22
00:01:35.443 --> 00:01:37.064
Gildong thought for a moment.

23
00:01:37.085 --> 00:01:40.648
"I have an idea," he said.

24
00:01:46.913 --> 00:01:49.175
He scribbled some words onto a scroll.

25
00:01:51.137 --> 00:01:52.358
Then he looked at Mok.

26
00:01:53.338 --> 00:01:54.880
"We need to find you some new clothes."

27
00:01:58.448 --> 00:01:59.469
Nabi giggled.

28
00:01:59.489 --> 00:02:04.231
"You look like a real noble, Uncle Mok."

29
00:02:05.912 --> 00:02:07.854
Mok was dressed like an official.

30
00:02:07.874 --> 00:02:11.976
"Are you sure this will work?"

31
00:02:12.496 --> 00:02:13.617
he asked Gildong.

32
00:02:13.637 --> 00:02:17.439
"Can't you use your fan power to blow down the jail?"

33
00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.161
Gildong shook his head.

34
00:02:20.181 --> 00:02:22.562
"That's not a good idea.

35
00:02:23.603 --> 00:02:25.904
We need to free everyone quickly and quietly."

36
00:02:30.752 --> 00:02:33.713
Gildong and Mok went to the jail in Mungyeong.

37
00:02:35.874 --> 00:02:37.675
At the gate a guard stepped out.

38
00:02:37.695 --> 00:02:40.536
"Halt! Who are you, and why are you here?"

39
00:02:40.556 --> 00:02:43.898
"The governor of Gyeongsang sent me.

40
00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:47.720
I, uh, have a message from him," Mok said.

41
00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:49.981
Gildong held up a scroll.

42
00:02:51.641 --> 00:02:52.842
The guard reached for it.

43
00:02:52.862 --> 00:02:57.044
"No! The message is for the warden," Mok said.

44
00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:01.521
The warden appeared and took the scroll from Gildong.

45
00:03:04.322 --> 00:03:06.602
The guard looked over the warden's shoulder.

46
00:03:08.883 --> 00:03:09.743
"What does it say?"

47
00:03:11.144 --> 00:03:12.344
"Read it for yourself!"

48
00:03:12.824 --> 00:03:13.844
the warden snapped.

49
00:03:13.864 --> 00:03:17.806
"I don't know how to read," the guard said.

50
00:03:19.446 --> 00:03:20.566
The warden sighed.

51
00:03:20.586 --> 00:03:25.828
"It says the governor orders us to release our prisoners.

52
00:03:26.944 --> 00:03:29.066
The men we captured aren't Hwalbindang men.

53
00:03:30.006 --> 00:03:31.187
They're the governor's spies."

54
00:03:31.207 --> 00:03:34.089
"Really?" the guard asked.

55
00:03:36.791 --> 00:03:39.393
The warden gave Mok a suspicious look.

56
00:03:39.413 --> 00:03:42.675
"Something doesn't seem right about this message."

57
00:03:46.478 --> 00:03:48.339
dare you question the governor's orders!"

58
00:03:48.759 --> 00:03:49.540
Mok snapped.

59
00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:53.523
"He'll be very angry if he hears—" "Okay, okay!"

60
00:03:53.923 --> 00:03:54.844
the warden said.

61
00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.062
Soon the warden released the prisoners.

62
00:04:01.863 --> 00:04:04.884
The Hwalbindang made their way toward the city walls.

63
00:04:10.808 --> 00:04:13.590
Gildong saw a group of men coming through the gate.

64
00:04:15.431 --> 00:04:17.092
He recognized their uniforms.

65
00:04:17.112 --> 00:04:21.254
"We've got trouble," Gildong said.

66
00:04:21.274 --> 00:04:23.996
"The royal police are coming!"
